.
.  Generate sample output for Fatigue Life PPF plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na flppf4.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE SIZE 7
TITLE OFFSET 3
LABEL SIZE 6
TIC LABEL SIZE 6
LABEL CASE ASIS
X1LABEL Probability
Y1LABEL X
Y1LABEL DISPLACEMENT 13
FRAME CORNER COORDINATES 20 20 90 90
THICKNESS 0.2
.
MULTIPLOT 2 2
MULTIPLOT CORNER COORDINATES 0 0 100 100
.
TITLE Fatigue Life PPF (gamma = 0.5)
PLOT FLPPF(P,0.5) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Fatigue Life PPF (gamma = 1)
PLOT FLPPF(P,1) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Fatigue Life PPF (gamma = 2)
PLOT FLPPF(P,2) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
TITLE Fatigue Life PPF (gamma = 5)
PLOT FLPPF(P,5) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
.
END OF MULTIPLOT
.
box 0 0 100 100
device 2 close
system mv FLPPF4.PS flppf4.ps
.
. quit
